<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom decision on ally by early April.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom decision on ally by early April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom said on Wednesday that it expected to reach a decision on an international alliance by the end of March or beginning of April.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement accompanying its 1996 results that it was still in negotiations with potential allies.</p>
<p>The partner, or partners could take a small stake in Portugal Telecom.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
